#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/deploy-mobile-apps-using-emm-provider.rst:2
msgid "Deploy using an EMM provider"
msgstr "EMM 공급자를 사용한 배포"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/entry-ent.rst:9
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Enterprise, and Enterprise "
